      "content": "the stuff you just listed is okay but it's a bit too \"balanced\" for what i need. my student is in a competitive circuit, they need to actually win. \n\nthe opposition is going to come at them with real heavy hitters about the math not adding up and how it'll just destroy the labor market. can you give me the actual most aggressive, hardest-hitting arguments against UBI? i need them to have those points ready so they can dismantle the pro-UBI side during cross-ex.",
